  "onboardingNavigationDescription": "Swipe left or right to change page, tap numbers to navigate directly",
  "onboardingFavorites": "Favorites",
  "onboardingFavoritesDescription": "Save the pages you visit most often:\n\n• Tap the indicated icon to add the current page\n• Tap again to remove it from favorites\n• The icon turns red when the page is in favorites\n\nYou can save both national and regional pages.",
  "onboardingRegions": "Channels from All Over Europe",
  "onboardingRegionsDescription": "Select and organize your favorite channels from all over Europe.\n\nSearch by channel name or country name.\n\nYou can access teletext from Italy, Germany, Austria, Switzerland and many other European countries!",
  "onboardingAutoRefresh": "Auto Refresh",
  "onboardingAutoRefreshDescription": "When automatic refresh is active, the circle around the page number fills progressively:\n\nYou can change the refresh time in settings\n\nThe indicator is only visible when subpages are available and automatic refresh is active.",
  "onboardingPause": "Pause Update",
  "onboardingPauseDescription": "You can pause the automatic refresh of subpages:\n\n• Tap anywhere on the page where there are no clickable numbers\n• You will see the ⏸️ icon appear to indicate that the refresh is paused\n• Tap again to resume the refresh (▶️ icon)\n\nThis feature is useful when you want to read a subpage calmly without it changing automatically.",
  "onboardingPageSelector": "Page Selector",
  "onboardingPageSelectorDescription": "Tap the central number to directly enter a page.\n\nEnter a number between 100 and 999 to jump to that page.",
  "onboardingSubpageNavigation": "Subpage Navigation",
  "onboardingSubpageNavigationDescription": "If the page has subpages, you'll also see the indicator:\n• 1/3 means: first subpage of three available\n\nUse the central arrows to navigate between subpages:\n\n• Up arrow: go to next subpage\n• Down arrow: go to previous subpage\n\nThe arrows are active only when there are subpages available.",
  "onboardingSwipe": "Swipe Navigation",
  "onboardingSwipeDescription": "Navigate easily between pages with the gestures shown above.",
  "onboardingClickableNumbers": "Clickable Page Numbers",
  "onboardingClickableNumbersDescription": "Tap the highlighted page numbers to navigate directly to that page\n\n",
  "onboardingShortcuts": "Menu Shortcuts",
  "onboardingShortcutsDescription": "Quickly access the most important Teletext pages.\n\nUse this menu to jump directly to:\n• Page 100: National index\n• Page 200: News\n.....\nYou can also search pages by title by selecting the Search page option",
  "onboardingFavoritesList": "Favorites List",
  "onboardingFavoritesListDescription": "Manage your favorite pages:\n\n• Tap a page to open it\n• Swipe left to remove it\n• Tap the pencil to edit the description\n• Long press to change the order\n\n",
  "onboardingSettingsDescription": "Customize the app according to your preferences:\n\n• Load first favorite at startup: decide which Teletext page to start with\n• Theme: choose between light, dark or automatic\n• Auto refresh: enable automatic loading of subpages\n• Cache: manage page cache duration\n• Instructions: review this tutorial whenever you want\n• Backup Favorites: save and restore your favorites\n• Privacy Settings and reset: manage or reset your privacy choices",
